---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Gus Mahler"
  description="About Gus Mahler — publisher of Prediction Markets Weekly."
>
  <div class="prose-issue py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-serif mb-8 mt-0">About</h1>

    <p>
      I'm Gus Mahler. I publish <a href="/newsletter"><strong>Prediction Markets Weekly</strong></a>,
      a weekly briefing on the regulatory fight over U.S. prediction markets. Nine issues out the door since February 2026.
    </p>

    <p>
      I'm interested in prediction markets, financial regulation, and the market microstructure questions
      that sit underneath both. I'm looking for roles at prediction market platforms and adjacent fintech companies — if that's you, reach out.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Email is the best way: <a href="mailto:gus@gusmahler.com">gus@gusmahler.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>The newsletter</h2>
    <p>
      Prediction Markets Weekly covers the regulatory battle over U.S. event contract markets — CFTC rulemaking,
      Congressional legislation, court cases, and platform news at Kalshi, Polymarket, and competitors.
      I track the scorecard weekly so you don't have to.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/newsletter">Browse the archive →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h2 {
    font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    color: #888;
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
  }

  p {
    margin: 8px 0 16px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
</style>
